## 3. Spec Modules (`{{ spec_dir }}/modules/NN-slug.md`)

### Frontmatter (YAML)

```yaml
---
id: NN               # unique, zero-padded 2-digit number
title: "<title>"
status: <status>     # see valid statuses below
version: "X.Y.Z"    # semver
last_updated: YYYY-MM-DD
depends_on: []       # optional — list of MOD-NN IDs this module requires
origin: EXT-NNN     # optional — proposal ID this module was promoted from
---
```

**Valid statuses:** `draft` | `in-review` | `accepted` | `implemented`

### Required Sections

| Section                | Description                                         |
|------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
| **Executive Summary**  | One-paragraph overview of the module's purpose.     |
| **Inputs**             | Data, events, or triggers that feed this module.    |
| **Output**             | What this module produces (data, side-effects, UI). |
| **Acceptance Criteria**| Link to the companion AC file or inline criteria.   |
| **Edge Cases**         | Known edge cases and how each is handled.           |

