## 4. Acceptance-Criteria Files (`{{ spec_dir }}/acceptance-criteria/NN-slug.md`)

### Format Rules

- Each criterion is a section headed `## AC-NN.XX` (module number + criterion number).
- Every AC section **must** contain a table with columns: **#**, **Criterion**, **Pass**, **Notes**.
- Do NOT use Given/When/Then (BDD) format.
- The file **must** end with a `## Sign-Off` section.

### Example

```markdown
## AC-01.01 — Validates required fields

| # | Criterion | Pass | Notes |
|---|-----------|------|-------|
| 1.1 | All required fields present → submission succeeds | ☐ | |
| 1.2 | Missing "name" field → error shown for "name" | ☐ | |

## Sign-Off

| Role       | Name | Date | Status   |
|------------|------|------|----------|
| Author     |      |      | draft    |
| Reviewer   |      |      |          |
```

**Valid statuses:** `draft` | `in-review` | `accepted` | `signed-off`

---

## Status Lifecycle Summary

| Artifact   | Draft/Proposed → | Review       → | Approved      → | Final          |
|------------|------------------|----------------|-----------------|----------------|
| Decision   | `proposed`       | —              | `accepted`      | `deprecated` / `superseded` |
| Proposal   | `planned`        | `in-progress`  | `implemented`   | `cancelled`    |
| Spec       | `draft`          | `in-review`    | `accepted`      | `implemented`  |
| AC         | `draft`          | `in-review`    | `accepted`      | `signed-off`   |
